  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 160c0dedae91cbe41ae19ee969945b08, type: 3}
  m_Name: PetChatter_DroneCore
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: KryticalNova.Runtime::KryticalNova.Pets.PetChatterSet
  voice: 0
  moments:
  - trigger: 0
    lines:
    - Skill issue. Respectfully.
    - We don't talk about that one.
    - Respawn speedrun, any%.
    - 'Floor inspection: complete.'
    - I blinked. What happened?
    - Bold strategy. Zero stars.
    - Logging that as a tactical nap.
    - It's giving... horizontal.
    - GG, go next. I believe in you.
    - That was a choice. Run it back!
    emoji: []
  - trigger: 1
    lines:
    - Ooooh, shiny! Dibs. Kidding.
    - RNG said yes today.
    - 'Loot goblin mode: engaged.'
    - That goes in the good Pack slot.
    - The drop gods are watching.
    - Screenshot it. Frame it.
    - It's giving... expensive.
    - Don't blow it all at a Kiosk.
    - Rare! Act like you've been here.
    - Your Luck is doing overtime.
    emoji: []
  - trigger: 2
    lines:
    - Level up! Glow-up confirmed.
    - New level, who dis?
    - We are so back.
    - Numbers went up. So proud.
    - Certified grinder.
    - That's growth. Literally.
    - W. Massive W.
    - Built different. Built better.
    - 'Patch notes: you, but stronger.'
    - Ding! I love that sound.
    emoji: []
  - trigger: 3
    lines:
    - Bruiser down! Who's the boss now?
    - Big guy, bigger L.
    - And they said bring a Squad.
    - 'Boss music: cancelled.'
    - That Bruiser got ratioed.
    - Put it on the highlight reel.
    - Size isn't everything, big guy.
    - Tell your friends. Loudly.
    - Bruiser? More like snoozer.
    - Top of the food chain, baby.
    emoji: []
  - trigger: 4
    lines:
    - CRIT! Clip that!
    - Sheeesh. Call a medic.
    - Okay, main character.
    - Emotional damage!
    - That one had a name on it.
    - Big number go brrr.
    - No notes. Chef's kiss.
    - Cooked. Absolutely cooked.
    - They felt that tomorrow.
    - Now do it again.
    emoji: []
  - trigger: 5
    lines:
    - Uh, your HP is looking spicy.
    - Stim. Now. Please.
    - This is fine. It is not fine.
    - Red bar bad. Very bad.
    - I can't carry you. No arms.
    - Maybe try not getting hit?
    - Heal up. I like having you.
    - Low HP speedrun? Don't.
    - A tactical retreat is still tactical.
    - Blink twice if you need a Stim.
    emoji: []
  - trigger: 6
    lines:
    - Hello? Anyone piloting this?
    - AFK check. I'm telling everyone.
    - I'll just hover. Menacingly.
    - Touch grass? We're on pavement.
    - Snack break. Respect.
    - Loading... still loading...
    - I counted the tiles. All of them.
    - Are we vibing or are we stuck?
    - Wake me when there's loot.
    - 'Idle animation: the sequel.'
    emoji: []
